                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e21eafe3-cb27-41bc-ab24-e04ee497bec8",
                        "entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "воображе́нии"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c80e18da-c486-4a0d-b52c-50431570a00e",
                        "entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "воображе́ниях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cbf633e9-5059-3666-a66e-bbc3c518927f",
                        "entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "glosses": [
                            "способность мыслить образами, воображать"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "50dbb80e-0d9a-47d8-8063-42e664329c6c",
                                "sense_id": "cbf633e9-5059-3666-a66e-bbc3c518927f",
                                "text": "Мучения забыты, и память с трудом добывает их из пыли ветхих воспоминаний; одно величие Ливана всегда живо рисуется в воображении, уже охлаждённом опытностью, уже опустошённом проходами стольких привидений, стольких дум, стольких бесплодных надежд!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7efb3c6f-fb8e-3017-a2f1-a4d1beaa1bb7",
                        "entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "glosses": [
                            "способность к творчеству, к созданию новых образов путем комбинаций виденных ранее или действительных"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e0270f4-b64f-4bf6-8e78-d310774e49fb",
                                "sense_id": "7efb3c6f-fb8e-3017-a2f1-a4d1beaa1bb7",
                                "text": "Сего бы, конечно, не могло случиться, если бы, увлечённый своим плодовитым воображением, мог он остеречься от первой своей ошибки."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9dfbcfdb-af38-399f-b585-b8ea100a32c1",
                        "entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. домысел, мнение или предположение, ни на чём не основанное"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5de6a33e-a49c-426e-84a8-94f80882d5fe",
                                "sense_id": "9dfbcfdb-af38-399f-b585-b8ea100a32c1",
                                "text": "...остановись, говорю я себе, всё ведь это твоё воображение, не больше..."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b6889da-1d10-3f10-8f57-fa1c9040d627",
                        "entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. действие или состояние по значению гл. воображать; приведение чего-то на мысль, на память"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a46dcb7f-a4ea-444c-bfde-d3b6ecd26905",
                                "sense_id": "0b6889da-1d10-3f10-8f57-fa1c9040d627",
                                "text": "Ты плачешь, произнося прости; но воспомни о возвращении твоём, и да исчезнут слёзы твои при сём воображении, яко роса пред лицом солнца."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e99a9fa6-2a8e-3deb-9389-56574cd2c66d",
                        "entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. представление, понятие о чём-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb412738-517d-43b1-bc34-a6e2cb7fdfb2",
                                "sense_id": "e99a9fa6-2a8e-3deb-9389-56574cd2c66d",
                                "text": "Никто из нас, детей, разумеется, и воображения не имел, что такое наша Ольга Федотовна могла быть этому суровому старику в тяжёлой золотой шапке."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e45b92aa-8211-4da5-a7ed-ebba668c2443",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "target_lang_word": "imagination",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imagination",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02e47274-73ce-37d0-bf5a-a8a273b43043",
                                        "entry_id": "27cec5dd-9613-38ba-a2fe-149e45fe5eee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The image-making power of the mind; the act of mentally creating or reproducing an object not previously perceived; the ability to create such images."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8f1134e-7f50-4d7f-856b-b11b4d1ab197",
                                                "sense_id": "02e47274-73ce-37d0-bf5a-a8a273b43043",
                                                "text": "Imagination is one of the most advanced human faculties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b01536b0-8ea7-42da-ba24-7bbe02f5430f",
                                                "sense_id": "02e47274-73ce-37d0-bf5a-a8a273b43043",
                                                "text": "She removed Stranleigh’s coat with a dexterity that aroused his imagination."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf48a79f-224d-3e2f-8319-e041881aea42",
                                        "entry_id": "27cec5dd-9613-38ba-a2fe-149e45fe5eee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Particularly, construction of false images; fantasizing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cc823f2-2110-4cc0-b990-273b004fdde9",
                                                "sense_id": "cf48a79f-224d-3e2f-8319-e041881aea42",
                                                "text": "You think someone's been following you? That's just your imagination."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66657a7b-6a39-396c-9020-81f32c3f15eb",
                                        "entry_id": "27cec5dd-9613-38ba-a2fe-149e45fe5eee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Creativity; resourcefulness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cc5ca4a-986c-4166-9da8-abdc372d5310",
                                                "sense_id": "66657a7b-6a39-396c-9020-81f32c3f15eb",
                                                "text": "His imagination makes him a valuable team member."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e7066f6-be62-393e-821d-31e36d3c302b",
                                        "entry_id": "27cec5dd-9613-38ba-a2fe-149e45fe5eee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mental image formed by the action of the imagination as a faculty; something imagined."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7f63785-8161-4bd3-a609-841bea614b93",
                                                "sense_id": "3e7066f6-be62-393e-821d-31e36d3c302b",
                                                "text": "And yet the invention of young men, is more lively than that of old; and imaginations stream into their minds better, and, as it were, more divinely."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93d6077b-94e0-4919-8075-893286139e59",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "target_lang_word": "make-believe",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "make-believe",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d554ab4d-802a-3d52-89d6-7207f4582ff0",
                                        "entry_id": "cf96860f-c7ef-339a-8cb6-a0673e7896cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or act of pretending; acting as if something is true when in fact one knows it is not."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "sometimes",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "563b24db-4985-424e-9c31-a40a686aec96",
                                                "sense_id": "d554ab4d-802a-3d52-89d6-7207f4582ff0",
                                                "text": "Come on, come on, I go up and down / I like this curious feeling / I know, I see, it's like make believe / Cover your ears so you can hear what I'm saying"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "922ca9ea-c932-3f3b-bd9a-2fd56ead0a78",
                                        "entry_id": "cf96860f-c7ef-339a-8cb6-a0673e7896cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of pretending or imagining that things are better than they really are."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "sometimes",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fc78d41-9369-364b-a0f8-44e22e0d09f7",
                                        "entry_id": "cf96860f-c7ef-339a-8cb6-a0673e7896cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something imaginary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "countable",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f20c02b4-b9cf-44f0-b90d-9a1c8c440893",
                                                "sense_id": "3fc78d41-9369-364b-a0f8-44e22e0d09f7",
                                                "text": "‘You ought to be ashamed of yourself, Marjorie Lindon, to even think such nonsense. Are you all nerves and morbid imaginings,—you who have prided yourself on being so strong-minded! A pretty sort you are to do battle for anyone.—Why, they’re only make-believes!’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "make-believe",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b5a7010-dc0b-39bf-b866-cd540e5e5e41",
                                        "entry_id": "4793887f-3c12-3a5d-85ef-9fcc8397011c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Imaginary; not real; pretend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f402c286-d41e-46a1-a734-c78be9600cf4",
                                                "sense_id": "5b5a7010-dc0b-39bf-b866-cd540e5e5e41",
                                                "text": "He called himself Lord So-and-So, even had his family crest on the wall, but it was all totally make-believe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60e6fc54-5c3d-49e6-adac-21e74dc8f90f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef840bd8-839b-343c-ad5f-f94cd8d60357",
                        "target_lang_word": "Einbildungskraft",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Einbildungskraft",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e88e56d-459f-3ce6-9639-55c7c0093ce4",
                                        "entry_id": "2a93e788-6c0f-3d93-bba5-df405d81bc4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die Fähigkeit seine Fantasie zu benutzen, innere Bilder und Gedanken zu erzeugen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fe5e21e-2131-4950-a976-f1b16d1aabec",
                                                "sense_id": "6e88e56d-459f-3ce6-9639-55c7c0093ce4",
                                                "text": "Einbildungskraft ist das Vermögen, einen Gegenstand auch ohne dessen Gegenwart in der Anschauung sich vorzustellen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9596bdd0-58d0-4276-8a1a-ccae8318be77",
                                                "sense_id": "6e88e56d-459f-3ce6-9639-55c7c0093ce4",
                                                "text": "„Die Einbildungskraft entwirft Bilder, die einem inneren Auge sichtbar sind und in Medien zur Darstellung gebracht werden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ef50d02-d13e-4229-b9ca-f77d1543fe20",
                                                "sense_id": "6e88e56d-459f-3ce6-9639-55c7c0093ce4",
                                                "text": "„Sie malte es sich aus, wie sie die Frau des Fürsten Andrej sein würde, stellte sich das ihrer Einbildungskraft von unzähligen Wiederholungen her schon so vertraute Bild ihres glücklichen Lebens mit ihm vor Augen und musste sich doch, glühend vor Aufregung, alle Einzelheiten ihres gestrigen Zusammenseins mit Anatol wieder vergegenwärtigen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b75e7f9-6b40-4f64-adb6-91c037a04f9c",
                                                "sense_id": "6e88e56d-459f-3ce6-9639-55c7c0093ce4",
                                                "text": "„Die gerechte Sache hatte wirklich triumphiert, wie selbst die glänzendste Einbildungskraft nicht herrlicher hätte wünschen können.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c3599fd-f072-4d88-a9fd-40bfbe23fec7",
                                                "sense_id": "6e88e56d-459f-3ce6-9639-55c7c0093ce4",
                                                "text": "„Zwischen Klugheit und analytischer Fähigkeit besteht aber ein Unterschied, der größer ist als der zwischen Phantasie und Einbildungskraft; indessen ist er von streng analogem Charakter. Man kann beinahe mit Sicherheit behaupten, daß die klugen Menschen stets phantasiereich und die mit wirklicher Einbildungskraft begabten stets Analytiker sind..“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
